<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Sarah Wescot-Williams</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">b. <a href="/years/1956">1956</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Sarah Wescot-Williams is a politician from Sint Maarten who became its first prime minister on 10 October 2010, when the island became an autonomous country within the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kingdom-of-the-netherlands">Kingdom of the Netherlands</a> after the dissolution of the Netherlands Antilles. She had earlier led the island's executive council. She served as prime minister until 2014 and later as president of parliament.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/sarah-wescot-williams.jpg" alt="Sarah Wescot-Williams" width="320" height="394" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: superhilly · CC BY-SA 4.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sarah_Wescot-Williams_(cropped).jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
<section class="enc-quotes"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Across the Institute</h2><ul><li><blockquote>Islanders had voted in 2000 for separate status, and it became an autonomous country within the Kingdom of the Netherlands, with <b>Sarah Wescot-Williams</b> as first prime minister.</blockquote><a href="/state/sint-maarten">Sint Maarten</a></li></ul></section>
<section class="enc-where enc-born"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Born and died</h2><p class="enc-born-p">Born in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/saint-martin-island">Saint Martin</a>. <span class="enc-born-src">Places as Wikidata records them.</span></p><figure class="st-locator enc-loc"><a href="/atlas?at=18.06,-63.05&amp;year=1991" aria-label="Saint Martin on the atlas"><svg class="map map-loc" viewBox="2840 1494 900 540" role="img" aria-label="Map: the birthplace of Sarah Wescot-Williams"><image href="/maps/world.svg" x="0" y="0" width="10000" height="4393"/><path class="map-dot-halo" d="M3290 1764h0"/><path class="map-dot-me" d="M3290 1764h0"/></svg></a><figcaption>The dot marks the birthplace. <a href="/atlas?at=18.06,-63.05&amp;year=1991">What was here in 1991? &rarr;</a></figcaption></figure></section>
